    "body": "## What\n\nMerge upstream v18.4.8 into the current fork integration branch. Preserve retained fork behavior, build-only version preparation, upstream approvals, and CI caches. The sole textual conflict combines independent manual-recap and upstream presentation test-context seams.\n\n## Why\n\nBring the fork and installed signed Arch package from v18.4.5 to the latest upstream release, v18.4.8. Preserve upstream source versions, release changelogs, and author attribution.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Source CI [#85](https://ci.n3t.work/repos/3/pipeline/85) passed for final head `89cb3dc14e116fdda28febc1c8cc10f6f9dcb06f`: frozen installation, lint/format/workspace types, Rust checks, web/native/CLI builds, and exact compiled fork-version assertion.\n- Initial CI #82 caught stale manual-recap test use of showStatus. Those contracts now observe upstream RecapNotice presentation and rendered content. No local compilation or test execution.\n- TS/Rust suites and worker smoke tests remain disabled under the temporary policy; checks/build success is not a test-suite pass.\n- Merged source: `82ffdde90f9e04d01678f544bba6276901093796`; feature branch retained. Upstream release changelogs and attribution preserved; no additional changelog entry requested.\n- Arch #198 failed due to host disk exhaustion. Managed storage recovery and its concurrent parser repair restored admission; this task made no infrastructure edits.\n- Arch [#201](https://ci.n3t.work/repos/2/pipeline/201) passed with source `82ffdde90f9e04d01678f544bba6276901093796`, recipe `22e4034acca14588d15f2b98fb9e782a00d39895`, and package `oh-my-pi-vith-git`. Existing provider policy retained; the dispatcher includes only recipe-relevant pins.\n- Published package and repository database signatures verified with trusted key `433D492D0438666BBB7230BB91D0A55E51016A94`. Signed database filename/version match the package; SHA256 `4cbd386b9d88fd53b8f65eb0db352345d1e794df413ecbcd515e9e49cc1e66ae` matches the downloaded package.\n- Pacman upgraded only `oh-my-pi-vith-git` to `18.4.8.vith.r326.g82ffdde90f9e-1`, retaining signature checks. PATH resolves to package-owned `/usr/bin/omp`; execution reports `omp/18.4.8+vith-fork.326.82ffdde90f9e`.\n\n---\n\n- [x] `bun check` passes\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] CHANGELOG updated with the required attribution (if user-facing; internal issue fixes use issue links, external contributions add the PR link and contributor credit after creation)",
